{"id":842305,"title":"16｜安装开发环境并生成首页","content":"本节课介绍了使用confusor生成网站功能的方法。建议分步骤生成每个页面或功能，以提高响应速度、避免触及token限制并简化调试过程。首先通过提供提示词和参考图片来生成首页，包括网站结构和设计文档。在生成过程中，利用agent模式自动安装所需依赖。遇到问题时，可以通过询问GPT等工具获取解决方案。强调了版本控制的重要性，以防代码被频繁修改导致混乱。尽管过程中遇到多次错误，但最终成功启动了React前端服务，并展示了与参考图片相似的界面风格。课程最后预告了下一课将生成文件转换功能。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397407,"user_name":"寒战🏈📚💻","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4075433,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"8E29AD98AAC59D","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3e/2f/a9/79b3e03d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738319212,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144209,"content":"为优秀的同学点赞，加油。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1738670828,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397407,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"最后还是实现了，对于不会写代码我，已经很强大了 ，但是要有些耐心，做的多了，路径方法都熟悉了，效率也就上来了","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656725,"discussion_content":"为优秀的同学点赞，加油。","content_length":12,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1738670828,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":398212,"user_name":"李壮","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2019934,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"423F1AF2F927D7","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/d2/5e/47350c98.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1740809250,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144472,