_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656549,"discussion_content":"抱歉。没明白你这个选择和cursor多轮拉扯是什么意思。\n对于学习cursor，自己看官网指南也是可以的哈，不过官网指南提供的内容大部分是偏介绍的。","content_length":74,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1737895627,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":3829751,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3a/6f/f7/970ff191.jpg","nickname":"😀 _小机灵","note":"","ucode":"F2A645D066508F","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656757,"discussion_content":"不是不是，我不是说学习cursor，而是在使用某个新的工具或者框架时，cursor写出来一般来说都要调整多轮，比如引用的版本，参数的配置之类的，需要多次沟通，有时候cursor会陷入错误的循环里一直重复生成错误的代码（cursor会说抱歉刚才xxx不对，然后生成新的也没有改正，这种情况非常消耗耐心）。相比之下根据新工具官网的接入指南（基本上都会提供copy功能），可能没有那么快，但是会比较稳定。","content_length":199,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1738734838,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"四川","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397224,"user_name":"随遇而安丶","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1358656,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"57E175E4FF7E3A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/bb/40/5ba38cfa.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1737339385,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144132,"content":"复杂项目，比如多个功能的项目，确实需要一个功能一个功能的分步执行，搭建环境也是分步执行中的一个步骤","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1737343729,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397224,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"s